SUMMARY:Paddington Screening w/ Marmalade Making
DESCRIPTION:"Did you know that marmalade has all the vitamins and minerals 
 that a bear needs to get through their day?" - Paddington Bear\n\nThat's 
 right! And now you too can be nourished by the orange goodness that 
 everyone's favorite small bear can't get enough of. Come watch the 
 excellent first Paddington movie with us in the children's programming 
 room\, accompanied by a marmalade making workshop. We will make our 
 marmalade while the movie plays and everyone will leave with a jar of 
 delicious homemade marmalade. I will also provide some pre-made marmalade 
 for consumption and bread for attendees while the film 
 plays.\n\nRegistration is encouraged\, but not required! The film is rated 
 PG for some exciting sequences and references\, with a runtime of 95 
 minutes.
