SUMMARY:Digital Brilliance Hour: Game Development and Music Production
DESCRIPTION:This program is designed for teens aged 12-19\, interested in 
 Game Development and Music Production. Over this workshop series\, students 
 dive deep into hands-on activities\, from mastering digital audio 
 workstations to coding their first game\, all while enhancing 
 collaboration\, communication\, and decision-making skills.\n\n 
 \n\nParticipants will need to use their own email address for the software 
 being used in the workshop.\n
