 background-color: #f5f5f5\;\n}\n\nSummer Reading Kickoff at Bragtown: 
 Unearth a Story!\nFriday\, June 12\, 2026 | 11:00 AM – 2:00 PM\n\nGet 
 ready to dig into adventure! Join us at the Bragtown Branch Library as we 
 kick off Summer Reading with a fun‑filled\, dinosaur‑themed celebration 
 inspired by this year’s theme: "Unearth a Story".\n\nBring your curiosity 
