SUMMARY:Crafting for Littles: Ice Painting
DESCRIPTION:Babies and toddlers up to 2 years old (and their caregivers!) 
 are welcome to join us on the 2nd and 4th Friday of every month this summer 
 for some very simple crafts! Crafting encourages babies and toddlers to 
 exercise their fine motor skills and eye-hand coordination\, develop their 
 critical thinking skills\, and get creative!\n\nThis week\, we will make 
 some paintings on cardstock paper using "ice brushes"! The "ice brushes" 
 will be taste-safe and made with ice\, popsicle sticks\, and food 
 coloring.\n\nRegistration is required.\n\nIf you have any questions\, 
 please contact us @ 919-560-8592.
