SUMMARY:Durham Cultural Roadmap
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a drop-by session about the Durham Cultural 
 Roadmap—a collaborative plan led by the City of Durham and Durham County 
 to shape the future of arts and culture across Durham. \n\n\n\nCity and 
 County staff will be available to answer questions\, share information 
 about the planning process\, and explain how community feedback has guided 
 the plan to date to support artists\, families\, cultural organizations\, 
 and neighborhoods across Durham.\n\n\n\nResidents are invited to stop by\, 
 learn more\, ask questions\, and share ideas about Durham’s creative 
 future.\n\n
LOCATION:North Regional Library (221 Milton Rd)
