 dinos\, and mini monstera leaves\, shake it up\, watch the glitter swirl\, 
 and learn to use it as a stress-management tool to practice 
 mindfulness!\n\nFor participants ages 9-18.\n\nDue to limited supplies\, 
 registration is required. Please reach out to Ezra\, South Regional's Teen 
 Librarian at eletson@dconc.gov with any questions!\n\n \n\n
