SUMMARY:Renovation Planning Basics with Home Repair Lab
DESCRIPTION:Ready to start a renovation but want guidance on how to plan? 
 Using questionnaires and templates\, learn how to define your scope\, 
 manage your budget\, and set a project timeline. Learn the how\, when\, and 
 why of permitting. We will also cover working with labor whether it is 
 contractors\, friends\, or family for a successful project outcome. Join 
 Chris and Mindy Meyers from Home Repair Lab to learn about renovation 
 planning basics in this class! Relevant for homeowners and first time home 
 buyers. The first hour will be lecture\, followed by Q&A. \n\nIf you have 
 any accessibility questions or accommodation needs\, please contact us at 
 Maker_STEAM@dconc.gov. We ask that all requests be made at least 3 business 
 days prior to the event to ensure we can provide the best accommodations 
 possible.
LOCATION:Conference Room #3214\, Main Library (300 N. Roxboro St)
ORGANIZER;CN="Larkin Coffey":MAILTO:lcoffey@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:Maker, STEAM
