SUMMARY:Kathi's Klowns: Dino Adventure Show
DESCRIPTION:Kathi's Klowns presents their new summer show: The Great 
 Dinosaur Adventure Show\, which is their signature blend of magic\, 
 storytelling\, and puppetry\, all themed around dinosaurs and pre-historic 
 times. The show runs about 45 minutes\, includes lots of audience 
