SUMMARY:Shelf Sessions with Tecoby
DESCRIPTION:Hailing from Rocky Mount\, North Carolina—the birthplace of 
 jazz legend Thelonious Monk—Tecoby is an artist who defies 
 categorization. Singing and rapping with equal conviction\, Tecoby moves 
 fluidly through hip-hop\, jazz\, R&B\, and soul\, crafting music that is 
 both introspective and boundary-pushing.\n\nJoin us for a live and intimate 
 musical performance at the library!
