SUMMARY:Ready\, Set\, Baby Class (English)
DESCRIPTION:Free prenatal breastfeeding education class designed to help 
 families get ready for a new baby\, whether you are a first-time parent or 
 adding to your family. These classes are a great way to prepare for 
 pregnancy\, birth\, and life with a newborn. You’ll get helpful 
 information on breastfeeding\, postpartum care\, and what to expect in 
 those early weeks. Our class is packed with conversations\, resources\, and 
 a raffle prize at the end! You’ll have a chance to win amazing prizes 
 like:\n\n\n	Breast pumps\n	Baby Clothing\n	Breastfeeding supplies\n	Diaper 
 bags full of essentials\n\n\n\n	Breastfeeding pillows\n\n\n…and more!
LOCATION:South Meeting Room\, South Regional Library (4505 S. Alston Ave)
ORGANIZER;CN="Donielle F.":MAILTO:dlfonville@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:Health & Fitness
