SUMMARY:Carolina Blaze Family Storytime
DESCRIPTION:Did you know that Durham is home to a women's professional 
 softball team? The Carolina Blaze are one of the four original teams in the 
 Athletes Unlimited Softball League (AUSL) - a professional softball league 
 in the United States.\n\nThe Carolina Blaze will be co-hosting a family 
 storytime with Durham County Library! Come meet some of the players\, enjoy 
 a softball themed storytime\, and a craft. The event is open to families 
 and all ages.\n\nYou can catch the Durham County Library Bookmobile at the 
 Carolina Blaze game on Saturday\, July 18th. \n\nThis program has a mix of 
 sensory elements\, some high energy (e.g. singing and moving) and some low 
 energy (e.g. listening quietly to stories).\n\nIf you have any 
 accessibility questions or accommodation needs\, please contact Sara at 
 sgibson@dconc.gove. We ask that all requests be made at least 3 business 
