SUMMARY:Small Business Finances & Lending Class
DESCRIPTION:\na {\n    text-decoration: none\;\n    color: #464feb\;\n}\ntr 
 th\, tr td {\n    border: 1px solid #e6e6e6\;\n}\ntr th {\n    
 background-color: #f5f5f5\;\n}\n\n\n\nCome learn more about small business 
 financial literacy. We'll discuss the different types of small businesses 
 and their corresponding documentation as well as managing the cash flow 
 cycle of operating your business. This session will also highlight common 
 financial challenges new entrepreneurs face and practical strategies to 
 overcome them. Participants will gain insights into budgeting\, 
 forecasting\, and building sustainable financial habits. Whether you're 
 just starting out or looking to strengthen your operations\, this workshop 
 will equip you with tools to make confident financial decisions.\n\nHosted 
 by Fifth Third Bank at University Place\n\n
